{"id":"n70067-1-22","stage":1,"title":"잊다 · 忘","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70067-1-22-1","ko":"저 사람이 이름이 뭐였더라? 기억이 안 나.","zh":"那个人叫什么来着？我记不起来了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람이","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이름이","meaning":"姓名","explanation":"이름：姓名；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이름","audio":"/audio/253d1510caf5362045ce.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71692","senseId":"3","lemma":"이름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐였더라?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기억이","meaning":"记着，记住","explanation":"기억：记着，记住；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기억","audio":"/audio/603669bd762779d98169.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38812","senseId":"1","lemma":"기억","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나.","meaning":"想起、记起来（기억이 나다）","explanation":"나다：想起、记起来（기억이 나다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"21","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71214","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人较远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"253d1510caf53620","term":"이름","zh":"姓名","audio":"/audio/253d1510caf5362045ce.mp3","entryId":"71692","definition":"人的姓氏及附加在其后面的，只称呼其人的称号。","pronunciation":["이름"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"603669bd762779d9","term":"기억","zh":"记着，记住","audio":"/audio/603669bd762779d98169.mp3","entryId":"38812","definition":"不忘记或重新想起以前的模样、事实、知识、经验等。","pronunciation":["기억"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"想起、记起来（기억이 나다）","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"想起、记起来（기억이 나다）","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f800f8fdd49e5029e555.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70067-1-22-2","ko":"벌써 잊었어? 아까 가르쳐 줬잖아.","zh":"已经忘了吗？刚才不是已经告诉过你了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잊었어?","meaning":"忘，忘记，忘却","explanation":"잊다：忘，忘记，忘却；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"잊다","audio":"/audio/b0566314f635fe32e273.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70067","senseId":"1","lemma":"잊다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아까","meaning":"刚才，方才，刚刚","explanation":"아까：刚才，方才，刚刚","readings":[{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65974","senseId":"1","lemma":"아까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가르쳐","meaning":"告诉，指","explanation":"가르치다：告诉，指；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"가르치다","audio":"/audio/b630a8848339bddb2b9f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62255","senseId":"4","lemma":"가르치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"줬잖아.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d038c1cb7ee215cb","term":"벌써","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3","entryId":"58977","definition":"比想象早地。","pronunciation":["벌써"]},{"id":"b0566314f635fe32","term":"잊다","zh":"忘，忘记，忘却","audio":"/audio/b0566314f635fe32e273.mp3","entryId":"70067","definition":"本来知道的事情记不住或记不起来。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"5dbe3d17e9e85489","term":"아까","zh":"刚才，方才，刚刚","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3","entryId":"65974","definition":"不久以前。","pronunciation":["아까"]},{"id":"b630a8848339bddb","term":"가르치다","zh":"告诉，指","audio":"/audio/b630a8848339bddb2b9f.mp3","entryId":"62255","definition":"让对方知道原本不知道的事实。","pronunciation":["가르치다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5de2aac8ed945d14c9a5.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.86,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70067","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":31,"sequenceScore":1.3107,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["已经忘了吗？刚才不是已经告诉过你了吗？","听说你要去济州岛旅行？准备都做好了吗？","那个人叫什么来着？我记不起来了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["已经忘了吗？刚才不是已经告诉过你了吗？","那个人叫什么来着？我记不起来了。","听说你要去济州岛旅行？准备都做好了吗？"],"answer":0}]}
